A carrier whose file vanished from the path its base names stands pending; each moved set surfaces once the queue drains. `sense` reconciles named roots now; `vanished` names the roots whose file left unwatched. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

